-// Nutshell's SQLite database is opened read-only with Node's built-in driver
-// (Node 22.13+), one short-lived connection per query. Every statement is a
-// constant SELECT; values such as time windows are bound as parameters.
-// Nutshell runs SQLite in WAL mode, which a read-only connection can read as
-// long as the mint's -wal and -shm files exist (they do while it runs).
-// The database path comes from MINT_DB_PATH (Nutshell's MINT_DATABASE/mint.sqlite3).
